#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:7
#: 07472612fb09454593e36dc3b6c3b702 0aaf9652bb4a472aba82ebbfe7eabb59
#: 43bf2beb0fde4514a880a82c3ef73cd5 75458af81ef74474ac05ef10cf75f3aa
#: d7b4410b501049ae928bf41842192d53 da03b183faaf4fd49a9bc92f3096fe42
msgid ""
"XBee radios (also known as ZigBee radios) are generally not recommended over"
" the :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` and :ref:`RFD900 Radio "
"<common-rfd900>`.  Still there may be some situations where only an XBee can"
" be used so these high-level instructions could be helpful."
msgstr ""
"XBee 电台（也称为 ZigBee 电台）通常不推荐替代 :ref:`SiK Radio <common-sik-telemetry-radio>` "
"和 :ref:`RFD900 Radio <common-rfd900>`。但在某些情况下可能只能使用 XBee，以下高级说明可供参考。"

