#: ../../source/docs/common-telemetry-xbee.rst:30
#: 08ed69d9a7ad40d0a4a2cd7b9e6b2351 693b8b25d0994e028516178caf375b7e
#: 8c23b22346274f849c0be9a3b88e3738 9ba2472bf44343a59bf812a398809c20
#: a57c7f299adc4f54b8e38326ad594403 e71bf0cf23074a09862b673101269ce9
msgid ""
"Click on the diagram at the top of this page to see the individual wire "
"connections that must be made between the autopilot and Xbee module. Note "
"that in the diagram above only 4 wires are connected (GND, 5V, Transmit, "
"Receiver). The CTS and RTS (Ready-to-send) pins are left unconnected because"
" although connecting them should improve the data rate during the creation "
"of this wiki page we were unable to successfully connect. With the CTS and "
"RTS pins disconnected the BRD_SER1_RTSCTS (if using Telem1) or "
"BRD_SER2_RTSCTS (if using Telem2) should be set to zero (after making the "
"change the autopilot will need to be restarted)."
msgstr ""
"点击本页顶部的示意图可查看飞控与 XBee 模块之间必须连接的各引脚。注意上方示意图中仅连接了 4 根线（GND、5V、发送、接收）。CTS 和 "
"RTS（就绪发送）引脚未连接，因为虽然连接它们应该可以提升数据速率，但在编写本 wiki 页面时我们未能成功连接。在 CTS 和 RTS "
"引脚未连接的情况下，BRD_SER1_RTSCTS（使用 Telem1 时）或 BRD_SER2_RTSCTS（使用 Telem2 时）应设为 "
"0（修改后需重启飞控）。"

